    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 Simplified outline of this Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019#sec-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "This Act sets up the Australian Business Securitisation Fund.\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 5\n\nNo. 46, 2019\nAustralian Business Securitisation Fund Act 2019\n\nThe Fund consists of the Australian Business Securitisation Fund\nSpecial Account and the investments of the Fund.\nThe investments of the Fund must be debt securities that meet\ncertain requirements.\nThe Minister is responsible for making investment decisions for\nthe Fund, however, the Minister may delegate the power to make\nthese decisions.\nInvestment decisions must be made in accordance with any\ndirections given by the Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "This Act sets up the Australian Business Securitisation Fund.\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 5\n\nNo. 46, 2019\nAustralian Business Securitisation Fund Act 2019\n\nThe Fund consists of the Australian Business Securitisation Fund\nSpecial Account and the investments of the Fund.\nThe investments of the Fund must be debt securities that meet\ncertain requirements.\nThe Minister is responsible for making investment decisions for\nthe Fund, however, the Minister may delegate the power to make\nthese decisions.\nInvestment decisions must be made in accordance with any\ndirections given by the Minister.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e9671e87f25893b759ffae6ecd30be9e2a288d30f988d956ec7e1296b9489ff",
      "skos:note": "The Minister must make investment decisions for the Fund in accordance with directions given by the Minister."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019#sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Simplified outline of this Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "This Act sets up the Australian Business Securitisation Fund.\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 5\n\nNo. 46, 2019\nAustralian Business Securitisation Fund Act 2019\n\nThe Fund consists of the Australian Business Securitisation Fund\nSpecial Account and the investments of the Fund.\nThe investments of the Fund must be debt securities that meet\ncertain requirements.\nThe Minister is responsible for making investment decisions for\nthe Fund, however, the Minister may delegate the power to make\nthese decisions.\nInvestment decisions must be made in accordance with any\ndirections given by the Minister."
    },
    {
