      "values:originalText": "(5) Section 58 of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013 (which deals with investment by the\nCommonwealth) does not apply to an investment of the Fund."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-12-ss-5-norm",
