      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-13-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must Not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of giving a direction with a specific purpose.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) The Minister must not give a direction under subsection (1):",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(a) that has the purpose, or is likely to have the effect, of directly or indirectly requiring the Minister to make, or not to make, a particular investment;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-13-ss-4-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must Not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of giving a direction inconsistent with the Act.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) The Minister must not give a direction under subsection (1):",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(b) that is inconsistent with this Act (including the objects of this Act)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14 Credits to the Account",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019#sec-14"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(1) There must be credited to the Account amounts equal to the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2019;\n\n(b) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2020;\n\n(c) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2021;\n\n(d) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2022;\n\n(e) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2023;\n\n(f) income derived from an investment of the Fund;\n\n(g) a return of capital, or any other financial distribution, relating\nto an investment of the Fund;\n\n(h) the proceeds of the realisation of an investment of the Fund.\n\n(2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, determine that an\namount equal to a specified amount is to be credited to the Account\nat a time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the\ndetermination.\n\n(3) The time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the\ndetermination must be on or after the time the determination is\nmade.\n\n(4) The determination must be expressed to be for a specified budget\nyear.\n\n(5) Before making a determination under subsection (2), the Minister\nmust obtain the agreement of the Finance Minister to the\ndetermination.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) There must be credited to the Account amounts equal to the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2019;\n\n(b) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2020;\n\n(c) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2021;\n\n(d) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2022;\n\n(e) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2023;\n\n(f) income derived from an investment of the Fund;\n\n(g) a return of capital, or any other financial distribution, relating\nto an investment of the Fund;\n\n(h) the proceeds of the realisation of an investment of the Fund.\n\n(2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, determine that an\namount equal to a specified amount is to be credited to the Account\nat a time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the\ndetermination.\n\n(3) The time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the\ndetermination must be on or after the time the determination is\nmade.\n\n(4) The determination must be expressed to be for a specified budget\nyear.\n\n(5) Before making a determination under subsection (2), the Minister\nmust obtain the agreement of the Finance Minister to the\ndetermination.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a74452e301a8805908cd5be8499fa93ddeedad1d4b0c00e914fabffcb9dcd1ab"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019#sec-14",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14 Credits to the Account",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(1) There must be credited to the Account amounts equal to the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2019;\n\n(b) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2020;\n\n(c) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2021;\n\n(d) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2022;\n\n(e) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2023;\n\n(f) income derived from an investment of the Fund;\n\n(g) a return of capital, or any other financial distribution, relating\nto an investment of the Fund;\n\n(h) the proceeds of the realisation of an investment of the Fund.\n\n(2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, determine that an\namount equal to a specified amount is to be credited to the Account\nat a time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the\ndetermination.\n\n(3) The time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the\ndetermination must be on or after the time the determination is\nmade.\n\n(4) The determination must be expressed to be for a specified budget\nyear.\n\n(5) Before making a determination under subsection (2), the Minister\nmust obtain the agreement of the Finance Minister to the\ndetermination."
    },
