      "cof:title": "14(5) Credits to the Account",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Before making a determination under subsection (2), the Minister\nmust obtain the agreement of the Finance Minister to the\ndetermination."
