      },
      "dc:source": "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, direct that a specified amount is to\nbe debited from the Account on a specified day (which must be on\nor after the day the direction is made).\n\n(2) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(3) The Minister must give a copy of a direction under subsection (1)\nto the Finance Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, direct that a specified amount is to\nbe debited from the Account on a specified day (which must be on\nor after the day the direction is made).\n\n(2) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.\n\n(3) The Minister must give a copy of a direction under subsection (1)\nto the Finance Minister.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-16-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-16-ss-2"
        },
