      "values:originalText": "The annual report prepared by the Chief Executive Officer of the\nAustralian Office of Financial Management and given to the\nMinister under section 46 of the Public Governance, Performance\nand Accountability Act 2013 for a period must include a report on\nthe operation of this Act during the period.",
      "skos:definition": "The annual report prepared by the Chief Executive Officer of the\nAustralian Office of Financial Management and given to the\nMinister under section 46 of the Public Governance, Performance\nand Accountability Act 2013 for a period must include a report on\nthe operation of this Act during the period.",
