      "dc:source": "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be\nundertaken as soon as possible after each of the following:\n\n(a) the second anniversary of the commencement of this Act;\n\n(b) the fifth anniversary of the commencement of this Act.\n\n(2) The review must include a review of the effectiveness of this Act\nin meeting the objectives of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be\nundertaken as soon as possible after each of the following:\n\n(a) the second anniversary of the commencement of this Act;\n\n(b) the fifth anniversary of the commencement of this Act.\n\n(2) The review must include a review of the effectiveness of this Act\nin meeting the objectives of this Act.",
